---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';

const timeline = [
  { i: '01', h: 'The studio years', a: 'Craft & Teaching', d: 'Twelve years as a mixing engineer, producer, songwriter, and artist: 1,000+ artists, in Nigeria and internationally. Trained producers and taught the business of music.' },
  { i: '02', h: 'The pivot into sales', a: 'Systems & Revenue', d: 'Inside businesses across North America, from million to billion-dollar companies, learning how real businesses run: their tech, their teams, their pipelines, and how revenue actually gets made.' },
  { i: '03', h: 'Levi Henry Group', a: 'Today', d: 'The same teaching instinct, applied to a new room: building the people and the systems that produce revenue for individuals and small business owners.' },
];
---

<Base
  title="About | Levi Henry Group"
  description="The experience behind Levi Henry Group — 15+ years across business, sales leadership, and revenue operations."
>
  <Header />

  <main id="main">
    <!-- HERO -->
    <section class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 px-6 pt-14 pb-10 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:pt-20">
      <div>
        <p data-reveal class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-navy-600">About Levi Henry Group</p>
        <h1 data-reveal class="mt-4 font-serif text-4xl font-medium leading-[1.07] tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-5xl">Consulting, education, and technology that build revenue.</h1>
        <p data-reveal class="mt-5 max-w-xl text-lg text-ink-soft">Built on 15+ years across business, sales leadership, and revenue operations, put to work building the people and systems that produce yours.</p>
      </div>
      <figure class="group m-0 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-navy shadow-2xl shadow-navy/30" data-reveal>
        <img src="/assets/photos/headshot-editorial.jpg" alt="Portrait of Levi Henry" width="1280" height="1600" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[var(--dur-hover)] ease-[var(--ease-out)] group-hover:scale-[1.03]" />
      </figure>
    </section>

    <!-- PROSE -->
    <section class="border-t border-line">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl space-y-5 px-6 py-16 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft lg:py-20">
        <p data-reveal>As a mixing engineer, producer, songwriter, and artist, I served clients in Nigeria and internationally, working with more than 1,000 artists over the years. But it wasn't just the technical work. I trained producers coming up in the craft, and taught others how the music business actually works: how to build a career, price your work, and turn talent into something sustainable.</p>
        <p data-reveal>Then I pivoted directly into sales, working with businesses across North America, from million to billion-dollar companies. That's where I learned how successful businesses are actually built: the technology solutions that power them, how to identify the right tools for a given problem, how to build and train a sales team from the ground up, how to generate leads through inbound and outbound, and how to build and manage a pipeline that consistently turns into revenue.</p>
        <blockquote class="border-l-[3px] border-brass py-1 pl-5 font-serif text-2xl italic leading-snug text-navy" data-reveal>The pivot looked sudden from the outside, but the foundation wasn't new.</blockquote>
        <p data-reveal>Teaching producers how to build a career, teaching artists how the business side works. That's the same work I do now, just applied to a different room. Helping people build the skills that make them valuable, and helping businesses build the systems that turn that value into revenue.</p>
        <p class="font-serif text-xl text-navy" data-reveal>Levi Henry Group is where that experience became a business.</p>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- HERITAGE -->
    <section class="border-t border-line">
      <div class="mx-auto grid max-w-6xl items-center gap-10 px-6 py-16 lg:grid-cols-2 lg:gap-16 lg:py-20">
        <div class="group order-1 overflow-hidden rounded-lg bg-navy shadow-2xl shadow-navy/30 lg:order-none" data-reveal>
          <img src="/assets/photos/portrait-traditional.jpg" alt="Levi Henry in traditional Nigerian attire" width="1440" height="1800" loading="lazy" class="aspect-[4/5] w-full object-cover transition-transform duration-[var(--dur-hover)] ease-[var(--ease-out)] group-hover:scale-[1.03]" />
        </div>
        <div data-reveal>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-navy-600">Roots</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-4xl">Built in Nigeria. Sharpened internationally.</h2>
          <p class="mt-5 text-ink-soft">The work started at home, in studios across Nigeria, with artists chasing something real, and grew through rooms with international companies operating at a scale most never see up close. Both taught the same lesson: talent is common, but the systems that turn talent into income are rare.</p>
          <p class="mt-4 text-ink-soft">That's the perspective I bring to every engagement: the craftsman's respect for the work, and the operator's respect for what actually produces revenue.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TIMELINE (dark band) -->
    <section class="band-dark">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 lg:py-24">
        <div class="max-w-2xl" data-reveal>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-brass-soft">The path</p>
          <h2 class="mt-3 font-serif text-3xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Same instinct, different rooms.</h2>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-10">
          {timeline.map((t) => (
            <div class="grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] items-start gap-x-8 gap-y-1 border-t border-white/10 py-8 sm:grid-cols-[auto_1fr_auto]" data-reveal>
              <span class="font-serif text-2xl font-medium leading-none text-brass-soft sm:text-3xl">{t.i}</span>
              <div class="max-w-[54ch]">
                <h3 class="font-serif text-xl font-medium text-white">{t.h}</h3>
                <p class="mt-2 text-white/70">{t.d}</p>
              </div>
              <span class="hidden font-sans text-[0.7rem] font-semibold uppercase tracking-widest text-white/40 sm:block">{t.a}</span>
            </div>
          ))}
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- TODAY -->
    <section class="border-t border-line bg-paper">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-2xl px-6 py-16 lg:py-20">
        <p class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-navy-600" data-reveal>Levi Henry Group today</p>
        <h2 class="mt-3 max-w-[22ch] font-serif text-3xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-navy sm:text-4xl" data-reveal>Consulting, education, and technology, under one roof.</h2>
        <div class="mt-6 space-y-4 text-lg leading-relaxed text-ink-soft">
          <p data-reveal>Levi Henry Group is a consulting, education, and technology services company helping individuals build high-income skills and helping small businesses implement the systems they need to grow revenue. We work across three core areas.</p>
          <p data-reveal><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Consulting.</strong> Hands-on guidance for individuals and small businesses looking to build or scale sales development, marketing, and revenue operations, drawing on 15+ years of experience across business, sales, sales leadership and channel partnerships.</p>
          <p data-reveal><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Education.</strong> Practical training and resources that help people develop high-income skills, from sales development and outbound prospecting to marketing and paid acquisition, so they can build sustainable income streams on their own terms.</p>
          <p data-reveal><strong class="font-semibold text-ink">Technology Services.</strong> End-to-end build support for the infrastructure that makes revenue systems actually work: websites, funnels, payment integration, and the technical backbone behind client acquisition and sales.</p>
          <p class="font-serif text-xl text-navy" data-reveal>Strategy, teaching, and technical execution, brought together under one roof.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>

    <!-- CTA -->
    <section class="border-t border-line">
      <div class="mx-auto max-w-6xl px-6 py-16 lg:py-20">
        <div class="band-dark relative overflow-hidden rounded-2xl px-8 py-14 text-center ring-1 ring-white/10 sm:px-14" data-reveal>
          <p class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-[0.2em] text-white/60">Work with me</p>
          <h2 class="mx-auto mt-3 max-w-lg font-serif text-3xl font-medium leading-tight tracking-tight text-white sm:text-4xl">Let's figure out your next move.</h2>
          <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-xl text-white/75">Tell me where you are and what you're trying to build. We'll find the shortest honest path to revenue.</p>
          <a href="/contact" class="mt-8 inline-flex items-center gap-2 rounded-sm bg-white px-7 py-3.5 font-sans text-sm font-semibold text-navy transition hover:bg-ivory-deep">Book a call <span>&rarr;</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <Footer />
</Base>
